n Neck and Middle Peninsula.","extract_html":"<p><b>Robert Joseph Wittman</b> is an American politician and environmental health specialist serving as the U.S. representative for Virginia's 1st congressional district since 2007. A member of the Republican Party, his district contains portions of the Richmond suburbs and Hampton Roads area, as well as the Northern Neck and Middle Peninsula.</p>"}